{"availability":"available","full":"LukyVj/GSS","name":"GSS","description":"❴ ● ❵ GSS — GPU Style Sheets. A CSS-like language for 3D scenes: selectors, the cascade, nesting, keyframes and transitions, compiled into one raymarching shader for WebGPU and WebGL2. No Three.js, no meshes. Playground, VS Code extension, and a <gss-scene> tag for any page.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":101,"forks":5,"created":"2026-09-29T15:21:01Z","updated":"2026-10-14T12:25:18Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.gss-lang.dev","topics":["3d","compiler","creative-coding","css","glsl","programming-language","raymarching","sdf","shader","webgl2","webgpu","wgsl"],"demo":"https://www.gss-lang.dev/playground","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:05.672Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:05.672Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:05.672Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:01:05.851Z","stars":58,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:15:00.886Z","stars":94,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.263Z","stars":101,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-17T16:01:05.672Z","stars":101,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["3D scenes written in CSS, compiled into a single shader for WebGL2 and WebGPU.","GSS (GPU Style Sheets) is a 3D language for people who already speak CSS. Declare shapes in a @scene, style them with selectors, and the compiler turns it all into one raymarched shader. No Three.js, no meshes."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LukyVj/GSS/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8d5c4c8a761c4109b9b06a56f585446cea48b2cdd2c20ae00a109b9fc4298038","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.375Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.375Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"3D scenes written in CSS, compiled into a single shader for WebGL2 and WebGPU.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LukyVj/GSS/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":